#. module: bf_nfc_helpdesk
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_nfc_helpdesk/models/bf_nfc_gesture.py:0
msgid "%(quoi)s : %(texte)s"
msgstr "%(quoi)s: %(texte)s"

#. module: bf_nfc_helpdesk
#: model:bf.nfc.gesture,description:bf_nfc_helpdesk.gesture_ticket
msgid ""
"Approcher le téléphone demande une phrase, et le billet naît rempli : le "
"client de la fiche, l'endroit, qui a signalé et quand. Dans un menu, "
"{\"texte_fixe\": \"Plus de papier\"} crée le billet sans rien demander."
msgstr ""
"Bringing the phone close asks for one sentence, and the ticket is created "
"filled in: the record's customer, the place, who reported it and when. In a "
"menu, {\"texte_fixe\": \"Out of paper\"} creates the ticket without asking "
"anything."

#. module: bf_nfc_helpdesk
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_nfc_helpdesk/models/bf_nfc_gesture.py:0
msgid "Billet %s créé. Merci, c'est signalé."
msgstr "Ticket %s created. Thanks, it has been reported."

#. module: bf_nfc_helpdesk
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_nfc_helpdesk/models/bf_nfc_gesture.py:0
msgid "Cette pastille ne désigne aucune fiche."
msgstr "This tag points to no record."

#. module: bf_nfc_helpdesk
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_nfc_helpdesk/models/bf_nfc_gesture.py:0
msgid "Décrire le problème"
msgstr "Describe the problem"

#. module: bf_nfc_helpdesk
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_nfc_helpdesk/models/bf_nfc_gesture.py:0
msgid "Décrivez le problème en une phrase avant d'envoyer."
msgstr "Describe the problem in one sentence before sending."

#. module: bf_nfc_helpdesk
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_nfc_helpdesk/models/bf_nfc_gesture.py:0
msgid "Endroit : %s"
msgstr "Place: %s"

#. module: bf_nfc_helpdesk
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_nfc_helpdesk/models/bf_nfc_gesture.py:0
msgid "Envoyé en différé : le téléphone n'avait pas de réseau."
msgstr "Sent later: the phone had no network."

#. module: bf_nfc_helpdesk
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_nfc_helpdesk/models/bf_nfc_gesture.py:0
msgid "Fiche : %s"
msgstr "Record: %s"

#. module: bf_nfc_helpdesk
#: model:ir.model,name:bf_nfc_helpdesk.model_bf_nfc_gesture
msgid "Geste déclenché par une pastille NFC"
msgstr "Gesture triggered by an NFC tag"

#. module: bf_nfc_helpdesk
#: model:bf.nfc.template,name:bf_nfc_helpdesk.gabarit_imprimante
msgid "Imprimante ou photocopieur en panne"
msgstr "Printer or photocopier out of order"

#. module: bf_nfc_helpdesk
#: model:bf.nfc.template,exemple:bf_nfc_helpdesk.gabarit_signalement_bris
msgid ""
"Laveuse 1 ; buanderie du sous-sol\n"
"Porte du garage ; stationnement\n"
"Interphone ; hall"
msgstr ""
"Washer 1 ; basement laundry room\n"
"Garage door ; parking\n"
"Intercom ; lobby"

#. module: bf_nfc_helpdesk
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_nfc_helpdesk.field_bf_nfc_gesture__kind
msgid "Nature"
msgstr "Kind"

#. module: bf_nfc_helpdesk
#: model:helpdesk.ticket.channel,name:bf_nfc_helpdesk.channel_pastille
msgid "Pastille"
msgstr "Tag"

#. module: bf_nfc_helpdesk
#: model:bf.nfc.template,exemple:bf_nfc_helpdesk.gabarit_imprimante
msgid ""
"Photocopieur ; 2e étage\n"
"Imprimante couleur ; accueil"
msgstr ""
"Photocopier ; 2nd floor\n"
"Colour printer ; reception"

#. module: bf_nfc_helpdesk
#: model:bf.nfc.template,name:bf_nfc_helpdesk.gabarit_signalement_bris
msgid "Signalement de bris par les occupants"
msgstr "Breakdown reports from occupants"

#. module: bf_nfc_helpdesk
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_nfc_helpdesk/models/bf_nfc_gesture.py:0
#: model:bf.nfc.gesture,name:bf_nfc_helpdesk.gesture_ticket
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:bf_nfc_helpdesk.selection__bf_nfc_gesture__kind__ticket
msgid "Signaler un problème"
msgstr "Report a problem"

#. module: bf_nfc_helpdesk
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_nfc_helpdesk/models/bf_nfc_gesture.py:0
msgid "Signalé par %(qui)s le %(quand)s, par la pastille « %(pastille)s »."
msgstr "Reported by %(qui)s on %(quand)s, with the tag “%(pastille)s”."

#. module: bf_nfc_helpdesk
#: model:bf.nfc.template,description:bf_nfc_helpdesk.gabarit_imprimante
msgid ""
"Une pastille sur chaque appareil. Bourrage, toner, écran d'erreur : une "
"phrase, et le billet part avec l'appareil et l'endroit déjà remplis."
msgstr ""
"A tag on each device. Paper jam, toner, error screen: one sentence, and the "
"ticket goes out with the device and the place already filled in."

#. module: bf_nfc_helpdesk
#: model:bf.nfc.template,description:bf_nfc_helpdesk.gabarit_signalement_bris
msgid ""
"Une pastille sur la laveuse, la porte du garage, l'interphone. L'occupant la"
" tape, décrit le problème en une phrase, et un billet rempli (l'endroit, "
"l'heure, la fiche de l'immeuble) arrive à l'équipe de soutien. Les occupants"
" n'ont pas de compte : gravez ces pastilles sur des puces signées."
msgstr ""
"A tag on the washer, the garage door, the intercom. The occupant taps it, "
"describes the problem in one sentence, and a filled-in ticket (the place, "
"the time, the building record) reaches the support team. Occupants have no "
"account: engrave these tags on signed chips."
